WEBVTT

NOTE
Guide narration timing (local Kokoro voice). Regenerate after the ElevenLabs take.

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.620
Every industrial site changes by the hour.

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.080
Contractors arrive.

3
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.940
Equipment is isolated.

4
00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.120
Work moves.

5
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.250
Insurance sets conditions under which risk is accepted.

6
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.710
Good teams translate them into permits, briefings and checklists.

7
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.240
But no one can hold a moving site in mind.

8
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.890
On Roof 03, hot work begins, every safeguard in place.

9
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.380
Then a sprinkler zone goes offline.

10
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.450
Nothing looks different.

11
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.560
The conditions have changed, and nobody sees it.

12
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.550
If something goes wrong, questions begin afterwards:

13
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.890
What was happening?

14
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.520
Which condition applied?

15
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.320
Can you prove what was true?

16
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.260
Today, the gap is often discovered too late.

17
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.760
What if the decision existed when the risk changed?

18
00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.660
<v Worker>I'm welding on Roof 03 until six.

19
00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.960
Priora connects the work to the conditions that matter.

20
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:55.560
It checks the certificate and safeguards, and keeps the record.

21
00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.290
Prevention before the work.

22
00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.150
Proof as it happens.

23
00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.570
The sprinkler goes offline again.

24
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.070
This time, Priora sees it at once.

25
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.430
The risk owner decides:

26
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.630
change the work, knowingly retain the risk, or, in time, ask selected carriers to cover it.

27
00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.560
Most work remains ordinary.

28
00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:16.440
A few changes become explicit decisions.

29
00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.080
Record becomes trust.

30
00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:19.870
Trust enables decisions.

31
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.750
Decisions can carry price.

32
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.070
Price can connect to capacity.

33
00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:25.200
Priora.

34
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.620
Infrastructure for activity-level physical risk.
